      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Headache is a common complaint with many potential causes. Each patient should be thoroughly examined to identify the condition producing the headache. Appropriate treatment varies according to headache type, so therapy should not be initiated until the diagnosis has been established. Dr Diamond reviews the differential diagnosis of headache and techniques for managing its various forms."},
